  ('p', 'A trend forecast is only useful if it changes what you do. At Forecut, every detail, from a neckline to a fabric, carries a <b>status</b> for each season: <b>emerging</b>, <b>rising</b>, <b>peaking</b> or <b>fading</b>. This guide explains what each status means and how to act on it.'),
